- Allowlist provider endpoints/research sources; prevent SSRF and arbitrary URL fetching.
- Treat external content as untrusted; protect against prompt injection.
- Sanitize external text before rendering.
- Apply existing authentication/authorization.
- Respect licensing, redistribution, and retention constraints.
- Audit advisory generation and configuration changes.
- Prevent agents from bypassing deterministic risk controls or placing unauthorized trades.
- Log metrics for quote/history success, latency, requested/received candles, coverage/freshness, retries/rate limits, indicator failures, source freshness/duplicates, agent duration/status, model usage, publication-gate results, and cache hits/misses.
