## 16. Final quality bar

The result must be modular, typed, secure, observable, tested, market-aware, commodity-specific, evidence-led, statistically responsible, transparent about fact versus interpretation, resilient to outages/stale data/rate limits/malformed model outputs, readable on desktop/mobile, and backward-compatible with the existing gold app.

